    Add the prefab to your scene if not instantiated automatically
    Unlink the prefab in the scene hierarchy (right-click > Unlink Prefab)
    
    Configure to use your own camera and lighting
     Make sure there are NOT 2 cameras in the scene, the prefab that instantiates automatically or you drag  in scene hierarchy assumes you do not have camera in the scene
    
    Adjust materials and settings as needed
